{"observed_at": "2026-11-06T00:31:31.154704+00:00", "provider": "OpenAI Responses API", "requested_model": "gpt-6-sol", "question_id": "G09", "category": "broad_intent", "brand_prompted": false, "prompt": "출퇴근하면서 영어 공부할 방법 추천해줘.", "repeat": 1, "search_mode": "required web_search, medium, KR", "max_tool_calls": 3, "consumer_chatgpt_measurement": false, "measurement_type": "discovery", "status": "completed", "model": "gpt-6-sol", "answer": "출퇴근길에는 **새 내용을 많이 듣기보다, 짧은 자료를 반복해서 듣고 직접 말해보는 방식**을 추천해요.\n\n- **출근길 10분:** 내 수준에 맞는 영어 오디오를 듣고 핵심 내용 한 가지를 파악하세요. 영국문화원 LearnEnglish에는 수준별 듣기 자료와 대본이 있는 팟캐스트가 있습니다. ([learnenglish.britishcouncil.org](https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/listening?utm_source=openai))\n- **퇴근길 10분:** 아침에 들은 것을 다시 듣고, 유용한 표현 2~3개를 멈춰서 따라 말하거나 혼자 한 문장씩 만들어보세요. 운전 중이라면 화면은 보지 말고 오디오만 활용하세요.\n- **다음 날 2분:** 어제 표현을 보지 않고 떠올려 보세요. 간격을 두고 다시 떠올리는 연습은 어휘 학습에 도움이 됩니다. ([cambridge.org](https://www.cambridge.org/core/journals/studies-in-second-language-acquisition/article/abs/review-of-laboratory-studies-of-adult-second-language-vocabulary-training/18F0A5D1FFC829CE05931B2EEE83124A?utm_source=openai))\n\n처음에는 **한 편을 이틀에 걸쳐 반복**하는 것만 목표로 잡으면 부담이 적습니다.", "citations": [{"type": "url_citation", "end_index": 284, "start_index": 165, "title": "Practise English listening skills | LearnEnglish", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/listening?utm_source=openai"}, {"type": "url_citation", "end_index": 695, "start_index": 461, "title": "A REVIEW OF LABORATORY STUDIES OF ADULT SECOND LANGUAGE VOCABULARY TRAINING | Studies in Second Language Acquisition | Cambridge Core", "url": "https://www.cambridge.org/core/journals/studies-in-second-language-acquisition/article/abs/review-of-laboratory-studies-of-adult-second-language-vocabulary-training/18F0A5D1FFC829CE05931B2EEE83124A?utm_source=openai"}], "usage": {"input_tokens": 8652, "input_tokens_details": {"cache_write_tokens": 16, "cached_tokens": 4336}, "output_tokens": 338, "output_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 75}, "total_tokens": 8990}, "search_calls": [{"id": "ws_041dfcda37568a16016aed1fe4893c87d2b016295e2c4ff155", "type": "web_search_call", "status": "completed", "action": {"type": "search", "queries": ["site:britishcouncil.org learnenglish listening practice podcasts commute English", "site:cambridge.org language learning spaced retrieval practice vocabulary research"], "query": "site:britishcouncil.org learnenglish listening practice podcasts commute English", "sources": [{"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/listening"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/general/audio-series"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/general-english/audio-series/podcasts"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/apps/learnenglish-podcasts"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://www.cambridge.org/core/journals/studies-in-second-language-acquisition/article/abs/review-of-laboratory-studies-of-adult-second-language-vocabulary-training/18F0A5D1FFC829CE05931B2EEE83124A"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://www.cambridge.org/core/journals/studies-in-second-language-acquisition/article/effects-of-distributed-practice-on-second-language-fluency-development/4F6787916C198376CAD222934D3B37E4"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://www.britishcouncil.org/english/business/apps/learnenglish-podcasts"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://www.cambridge.org/core/journals/studies-in-second-language-acquisition/article/effects-of-distributed-practice-on-the-acquisition-of-verbnoun-collocations/AFDA91E8ECFDB03151056108E0341FA3"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/general/audio-zone"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://www.cambridge.org/core/journals/studies-in-second-language-acquisition/article/optimizing-l2-phonetic-learning/1DF617B31C08FE04252E293B83481493"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://www.cambrid